=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_Sword Corundum
Corundum battle sword
The best sword on Gipath.

=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_Sword Granite
Granite battle sword
With this weapon you can successfully fight goblins.
=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_Sword Jade
Jade battle sword
Great potential if you infuse it with magic!

=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_Sword Malachite
Obsidian battle sword
One of the best.

=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_Sword Rock
Stone battle sword
This weapon is quite good, but the material chosen for it is unfortunate.

=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_Sword Silicon
Silicon battle sword
Not a bad weapon, well worth the price.

